        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to MOGA MASH</strong> — a fast-paced arcade world where every second tests your reflexes, timing, and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Travel Through Worlds</strong><br>Teleport through colorful realms — from blazing volcano skies to glowing underwater jungles — each alive with music, motion, and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Power-Up or Perish</strong><br>Use the <i>Fire Mode</i> to burn through obstacles or the <i>Blue Shield</i> to phase through danger. Every power-up changes how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple to Play, Hard to Master</strong><br>One tap to rise, release to fall — but every second counts. Perfect timing separates champions from ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Endless Replay Value</strong><br>Chase your high score, unlock new worlds, and master your rhythm in this beautifully reactive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Dynamic Music &amp; Visuals</strong><br>Every beat affects your surroundings — glowing pipes, moving backgrounds, and surreal particle effects that make the world come alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Two powerful modes — Fire &amp; Shield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Multiple teleporting worlds with unique designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Neon and glass-morphism visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Smooth PC and controller gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💫 Real-time reactive lighting and sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Instant restart and infinite replay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Dodge. Burn. Survive.</strong><br>This is <i>MOGA MASH</i> — a surreal rhythm of danger, color, and speed.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to MOGA MASH</strong> — a fast-paced arcade world where every second tests your reflexes, timing, and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Travel Through Worlds</strong><br>Teleport through colorful realms — from blazing volcano skies to glowing underwater jungles — each alive with music, motion, and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Power-Up or Perish</strong><br>Use the <i>Fire Mode</i> to burn through obstacles or the <i>Blue Shield</i> to phase through danger. Every power-up changes how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple to Play, Hard to Master</strong><br>One tap to rise, release to fall — but every second counts. Perfect timing separates champions from ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Endless Replay Value</strong><br>Chase your high score, unlock new worlds, and master your rhythm in this beautifully reactive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Dynamic Music &amp; Visuals</strong><br>Every beat affects your surroundings — glowing pipes, moving backgrounds, and surreal particle effects that make the world come alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Two powerful modes — Fire &amp; Shield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Multiple teleporting worlds with unique designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Neon and glass-morphism visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Smooth PC and controller gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💫 Real-time reactive lighting and sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Instant restart and infinite replay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Dodge. Burn. Survive.</strong><br>This is <i>MOGA MASH</i> — a surreal rhythm of danger, color, and speed.</p>",
